;; ### ## UPDATE OPERATORS (5-Operator Decomposition)

Λ (Lambda):        Domain-specific updates
  Λ_phys:          ψ' = ψ - iΔt·Hψ         where H = αL + V
  Λ_sem:           μ' = μ + (η - 2γ)Lμ
  Λ_agent:         a' = w_a·a + w_p·P(ψ,μ) + b

Φ (Phi):           Cross-domain coupling
Ξ (Xi):            V_i' = V_i + g_i(a),  F_i' = F_i + h_i(a)
dΩ (dOmega):       ψ ← ψ/‖ψ‖,  μ_i ← μ_i + λΣ_j A_{ij}(μ_j - μ_i)
VOID:              ψ_i ← 0 if |ψ_i| < ε,  μ_i ← 0 if |μ_i| < δ

Global Update:     U = VOID ∘ dΩ ∘ Ξ ∘ Φ ∘ Λ
Evolution:         O(t+1) = U(O(t))

;; ### ## CLASSIFICATION HIERARCHY

Fixed:             φ(w*) = w*
Periodic:          φ^p(w) = w,  p ≥ 2
