Chaotic:           h(φ) > 0
Universal:         ∃E: C → Σ* s.t. E(Next(c)) = φ(E(c))

Hierarchy:         Fixed ⊂ Periodic ⊂ Quasiperiodic ⊂ Chaotic ⊂ Universal

